@startuml vista-fisica
skinparam shadowing false
title Vista física (4+1) — despliegue de desarrollo de Piedrazul

node "Equipo de desarrollo" {
  node "Navegador" {
    artifact "SPA Angular\nlogin, registro,\nconsulta y perfil" as Spa
  }
  node "ng serve :4200" as Ng {
    artifact "frontend/" as Fe
  }
  node "JVM Spring Boot :8080" as Jvm {
    artifact "piedrazul-app" as Api
    component "AuthTokenService\nmapa en memoria\n8 horas" as Tokens
  }
  database "PostgreSQL\nlocalhost:5432" as Db {
    storage "app_users" as T1
    storage "doctors" as T2
    storage "appointments" as T3
  }
}

Spa -down-> Fe : carga la SPA
Spa -right-> Api : HTTP JSON\n/api/v1
Api -down-> Db : JDBC\nHibernate ddl-auto=update
Api -right-> Tokens : la sesión no sale de la JVM

note bottom of Db
  No hay Dockerfile ni docker-compose.yml.
  La URL está en application.properties.
  CORS solo permite http://localhost:4200.
end note

@enduml
